id: og_depot_b
name: Tram Depot II
description: Tram Depot. A fan of parallel roads under one roof with a pit level running across all of them, so upstairs you can only travel along and downstairs only across. Built as a tram depot; the fleet was withdrawn overnight and half of it is still in the shed.

grid: 1.7
wall_thickness: 0.3

